      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人发誓总有一天要在赛场上重逢，\n目白阿尔丹希望自己能成为一个\n不会让对手蒙羞的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8322291e36da674c64a9305583ed45f2192e8dcc24a0558b8d8ddeb7f643f21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
